    "type": "question",
    "label": "9",
    "prompt": "Four people each paid $\\$2$ towards the cost of a raffle ticket, which won a prize of $\\$x$. The prize was shared equally amongst the four, and each person made a profit of $\\$123$. What was the amount of the prize?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\$500$",
      "worked": "Each person's profit is their share of the prize minus their contribution.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{x}{4}-2&=123\\\\\\frac{x}{4}&=125\\\\x&=500\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe prize was $\\$500$.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
